    <h1>Carpet Roll Length Optimization</h1>
    <p class="project-subtitle">Replacing a one-size-fits-all 900 yard preset with a statistically confirmed, style-specific wind target — Mohawk Industries, Glasgow, VA</p>
    <div class="tags" style="margin-top: 14px;">
